    {
      "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 Matching agency",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary of the Social Services Department is to ensure that\nthere are officers of that Department who are responsible for the\nmatching of data under this Act.\n\n(2) While a direction under section 3A is in force, the Chief Executive\nCentrelink is to ensure that there are Departmental employees\n(within the meaning of the Human Services (Centrelink) Act 1997)\nwho are responsible for the matching of data under this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary of the Social Services Department is to ensure that\nthere are officers of that Department who are responsible for the\nmatching of data under this Act.\n\n(2) While a direction under section 3A is in force, the Chief Executive\nCentrelink is to ensure that there are Departmental employees\n(within the meaning of the Human Services (Centrelink) Act 1997)\nwho are responsible for the matching of data under this Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-4-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-4-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0c3396f630a0c1fa6d6cf4a998729c70a834269794a0093462b42a9639fe45d9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Matching agency",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary of the Social Services Department is to ensure that\nthere are officers of that Department who are responsible for the\nmatching of data under this Act.\n\n(2) While a direction under section 3A is in force, the Chief Executive\nCentrelink is to ensure that there are Departmental employees\n(within the meaning of the Human Services (Centrelink) Act 1997)\nwho are responsible for the matching of data under this Act."
    },
