      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Act does not limit the application of other laws of the\nCommonwealth except to the extent (if any) that they are\ninconsistent with this Act.\n\n(2) Rules in force under section 17 of the Privacy Act 1988, in relation\nto TFN data or tax-file number information are not breached where\nan agency has complied with the provisions of this Act.\n\n(3) Any oath or declaration made by an officer of a source agency in\nrelation to the recording or disclosure of information is not broken\nby the officer doing anything for the purposes of, and in the course\nof, carrying out functions or duties under this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Act does not limit the application of other laws of the\nCommonwealth except to the extent (if any) that they are\ninconsistent with this Act.\n\n(2) Rules in force under section 17 of the Privacy Act 1988, in relation\nto TFN data or tax-file number information are not breached where\nan agency has complied with the provisions of this Act.\n\n(3) Any oath or declaration made by an officer of a source agency in\nrelation to the recording or disclosure of information is not broken\nby the officer doing anything for the purposes of, and in the course\nof, carrying out functions or duties under this Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
