      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "Where the check identifies TFN data that appears to be incorrect,\nthe matching agency gives particulars of the data to the source\nagency that gave it.\nSTEP 2",
      "skos:definition": "Where the check identifies TFN data that appears to be incorrect,\nthe matching agency gives particulars of the data to the source\nagency that gave it.\nSTEP 2",
