      "values:originalText": "The tax agency gives the matching agency the data found out under\nparagraph 7 and any identification numbers for the purposes of\npersonal assistance of the person.",
      "skos:definition": "The tax agency gives the matching agency the data found out under\nparagraph 7 and any identification numbers for the purposes of\npersonal assistance of the person.",
