      },
      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "If the tax agency gives the matching agency tax file numbers under\nparagraph 8, the tax agency may indicate to the matching agency\nwhich, if any, of those tax file numbers, according to the tax\nagency’s records, may have become known to, or used by, a person\nnot authorised to know or use that tax file number.\nSTEP 4",
      "skos:definition": "If the tax agency gives the matching agency tax file numbers under\nparagraph 8, the tax agency may indicate to the matching agency\nwhich, if any, of those tax file numbers, according to the tax\nagency’s records, may have become known to, or used by, a person\nnot authorised to know or use that tax file number.\nSTEP 4",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-8a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eb5eab45f259b85e48c08bb189f667a4594249796f22e0bec02a6854641d657b",
      "skos:note": "Tax agency may indicate tax file numbers used by unauthorized persons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-8a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8A Section 8A",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "If the tax agency gives the matching agency tax file numbers under\nparagraph 8, the tax agency may indicate to the matching agency\nwhich, if any, of those tax file numbers, according to the tax\nagency’s records, may have become known to, or used by, a person\nnot authorised to know or use that tax file number.\nSTEP 4"
    },
