      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "The matching agency carries out payment matching by matching\nthe following data given by assistance agencies in Step 1:\n\n(a) family identity data; and\n\n(b) if it is necessary to do so—personal assistance data;\nto find out:",
      "skos:definition": "The matching agency carries out payment matching by matching\nthe following data given by assistance agencies in Step 1:\n\n(a) family identity data; and\n\n(b) if it is necessary to do so—personal assistance data;\nto find out:",
      "cml:asserts": [
