    {
      "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10(2) Source agencies may use results of data program",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-10-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where a source agency receives particular information under Step\n1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the agency must destroy that\nparticular information within 90 days of its receipt unless, within\nthose days:\n\n(a) the agency has considered that particular information and\nmade a decision:\n\n(i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of\nthat particular information; or\n\n(ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action\nallowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular\ninformation; or\n\n(b) the agency has, by using sampling procedures, identified that\nparticular information as information that will form the basis\nfor the agency:\n\n(i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of\nthat particular information; or\n\n(ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action\nallowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular\ninformation.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Where a source agency receives particular information under Step\n1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the agency must destroy that\nparticular information within 90 days of its receipt unless, within\nthose days:\n\n(a) the agency has considered that particular information and\nmade a decision:\n\n(i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of\nthat particular information; or\n\n(ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action\nallowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular\ninformation; or\n\n(b) the agency has, by using sampling procedures, identified that\nparticular information as information that will form the basis\nfor the agency:\n\n(i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of\nthat particular information; or\n\n(ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action\nallowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular\ninformation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2-logic-deontic-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-10-ss-2-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "62ccd4a778e5d8ffa9e623fc5ac678eb3a24112ff92b146875e9c04bc1d4bc63",
      "skos:note": "Destroy particular information within 90 days unless certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-10-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(2) Source agencies may use results of data program",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where a source agency receives particular information under Step\n1, 4 or 6 of a data matching cycle, the agency must destroy that\nparticular information within 90 days of its receipt unless, within\nthose days:\n\n(a) the agency has considered that particular information and\nmade a decision:\n\n(i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of\nthat particular information; or\n\n(ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action\nallowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular\ninformation; or\n\n(b) the agency has, by using sampling procedures, identified that\nparticular information as information that will form the basis\nfor the agency:\n\n(i) to take action allowed by subsection (1) on the basis of\nthat particular information; or\n\n(ii) to carry out an investigation of the need to take action\nallowed by subsection (1) on the basis of that particular\ninformation."
    },
