      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(4) After the completion of action taken in accordance with\nsubsection (1), a source agency must not retain any information",
      "skos:definition": "(4) After the completion of action taken in accordance with\nsubsection (1), a source agency must not retain any information",
