      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10(4) Source agencies may use results of data program",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(4) After the completion of action taken in accordance with\nsubsection (1), a source agency must not retain any information"
