    {
      "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-12-2-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12(6) Rules relating to privacy",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-12-2-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite section 12 of the Legislation Act 2003, rules issued under\nthis section commence from:\n\n(a) the first day on which the rules are no longer subject to\ndisallowance; or\n\n(b) if the rules make provision for their commencement after that\nday—in accordance with that provision.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Despite section 12 of the Legislation Act 2003, rules issued under\nthis section commence from:\n\n(a) the first day on which the rules are no longer subject to\ndisallowance; or\n\n(b) if the rules make provision for their commencement after that\nday—in accordance with that provision.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-12-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-12-2-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990-sec-12-2-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fb5a7ed589788758a6b396dbb6179ae8c819b671b088ae20078ca582812969ef",
      "skos:note": "Commencement of rules issued under section 12(6) of the Legislation Act 2003"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/data-matching-program-assistance-and-tax-act-1990#sec-12-2-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12(6) Rules relating to privacy",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 22,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Despite section 12 of the Legislation Act 2003, rules issued under\nthis section commence from:\n\n(a) the first day on which the rules are no longer subject to\ndisallowance; or\n\n(b) if the rules make provision for their commencement after that\nday—in accordance with that provision."
    },
